  publisher = "SAGE Publications Inc",
  volume    =  86,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "1--20",
  abstract  = "This article aims to broaden the understanding of
               quasi-experimental methods among marketing scholars and those who
               read their work by describing the underlying logic and set of
               actions that make their work convincing. The purpose of
               quasi-experimental methods is, in the absence of experimental
